WEBVTT

00:01:36.560 --> 00:01:40.550
I'll come to pick you up when it's time to depart for your cleansing.

00:02:03.050 --> 00:02:07.620
<i>So you're saying you'll marry me for just the sake of this country?</i>

00:02:08.670 --> 00:02:11.030
<i>Not because you love me?</i>

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:15.790
<i>You're proposing just so the Queen and the Grand Duke become a single entity?</i>

00:02:15.790 --> 00:02:18.550
<i>No!  I've always-</i>

00:02:18.550 --> 00:02:18.920
<i>You lie!</i>

00:02:29.410 --> 00:02:32.300
<i>Let's be married, Seimiya.</i>

00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:54.530
<i>I do not believe that an individual who does not know of the realities of this world should be Queen.</i>

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:02.120
<i>Cry your heart out.</i>

00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:11.550
<i>You may be the Queen to the citizens, but you're still the cute Seimiya to me, no matter what.</i>

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:22.920
I'm here because people wish for me to be the Queen.

00:03:25.540 --> 00:03:32.590
I've lived so far believing that accepting and following that destiny is the correct path to take.

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:41.990
Pure Night

00:03:42.590 --> 00:03:46.470
Lazal Beast-Lord Care Center

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:51.800
Nukku-san, Mokku-san!

00:03:53.470 --> 00:03:54.470
Little girl?!

00:03:54.470 --> 00:03:55.480
Erin-chan?

00:03:55.480 --> 00:03:56.630
Keep it down!

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:01.610
What's the matter?

00:04:02.290 --> 00:04:04.990
I'll be back by dawn.

00:04:04.990 --> 00:04:08.330
So can you let me out?

00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:23.200
Hurry along, little girl.

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:26.250
Thank you, Nukku-san, Mokku-san.

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:37.950
Seimiya, it's me.

00:04:38.680 --> 00:04:39.440
Enter.

00:04:47.100 --> 00:04:50.280
A little gift for the bride.

00:04:57.660 --> 00:04:58.860
Uncle.

00:05:00.690 --> 00:05:03.610
It won't be long before you'll stop calling me that.

00:05:06.510 --> 00:05:07.370
You're right.

00:05:12.960 --> 00:05:14.860
Take a look, Seimiya.

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:22.780
Every patch of land you can see from here is your country to govern.

00:05:23.750 --> 00:05:26.800
You must not be fooled by anything.

00:05:27.400 --> 00:05:31.650
We're the people chosen by the gods.

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:39.440
Will I be able to become a Queen like Grandmother was, just like the Founding Queen, Je?

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:42.940
The miracle at Tahai Aze will make you into one.

00:05:45.980 --> 00:05:49.700
The future of the Holy Kingdom lies within you.

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:52.970
I will be sure to stand by you.

00:05:57.460 --> 00:05:58.810
Uncle.

00:06:02.100 --> 00:06:03.960
Nami, requesting entrance.

00:06:06.600 --> 00:06:08.050
Come in.

00:06:12.610 --> 00:06:14.810
The preparations are complete.

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:18.910
Go on, Seimiya.

00:06:18.910 --> 00:06:26.920
Once you are blessed by the gods of Ryoza with a pure heart and body, there won't be anything to be afraid of.

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:28.390
Yes.

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:37.280
You're...

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:39.210
I'm here to get you.

00:06:40.650 --> 00:06:42.500
Return to our clan.

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:46.450
You mustn't use the Renditioner skills any longer.

00:06:47.320 --> 00:06:48.870
We can still stop this.

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:54.350
I can't go with you.

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:59.640
You're the daughter of Soyon, who was my fiancée.

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:05.500
I don't wish to see you perish along with the rest of this world because you've committed such a terrible crime!

00:07:06.060 --> 00:07:09.330
Erin, I've been watching you this whole time!

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:13.950
Since the day Soyon died and every day thereafter!

00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:34.230
You were just watching?

00:07:36.190 --> 00:07:46.080
You hide behind "obeying codes" and "stopping catastrophe" as excuses to rationalize people dying before you and tying down beasts.

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:49.310
Is that truly the right thing to do?

00:07:51.170 --> 00:07:55.470
Aren't humans the ones who need to change and not beasts?

00:07:56.640 --> 00:08:00.330
Humans are foolish creatures who repeat their mistakes.

00:08:01.270 --> 00:08:05.430
That's why we must be restricted by codes.

00:08:08.950 --> 00:08:12.090
You've given up all hope to begin with.

00:08:13.360 --> 00:08:18.060
That's why you restrict people using the word "crime."

00:08:19.220 --> 00:08:25.690
Even if it kills me, I don't want to restrict Lilan with codes designed by humans!

00:08:38.380 --> 00:08:39.500
Erin.

00:09:43.460 --> 00:09:44.320
What was that?

00:09:50.950 --> 00:09:52.480
A-A beast-lord?

00:10:03.760 --> 00:10:05.380
Who are you?

00:10:05.380 --> 00:10:09.060
Please forgive my intrusion, Your Highness.

00:10:09.060 --> 00:10:14.980
There is something I would like to speak to you about without anyone's interruption, so I have come in this manner.

00:10:16.280 --> 00:10:19.930
To control a beast-lord and soar in the sky...

00:10:20.740 --> 00:10:23.030
Are you Erin?

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:26.460
Yes.  I am Erin.

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:32.360
I was thinking of inviting you over soon.

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:38.030
If you had wished for an audience, I would have let you through, without having to do all this.

00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:46.050
With all due respect, I was told by Damiya-sama I could hold no audience with you.

00:10:47.850 --> 00:10:49.580
Why would Uncle say that?

00:10:51.410 --> 00:10:58.730
I believe he was afraid I might tell you the late Queen Harumiya's final wishes.

00:11:01.990 --> 00:11:04.200
Let's hear what you have to say.

00:11:04.760 --> 00:11:11.440
Seimiya-sama, are you aware of the promise Harumiya-sama and I made?

00:11:12.920 --> 00:11:13.960
No, I'm not.

00:11:15.560 --> 00:11:22.610
Harumiya-sama told me that I do not have to protect her with the beast-lords.

00:11:24.210 --> 00:11:28.800
She rejected a beast-lord as a guardian?

00:11:29.760 --> 00:11:36.550
I presume she believed the tale my mother's tribe has passed down.

00:11:37.940 --> 00:11:45.570
It's a story regarding your ancestors that took place upon the ancient Ephon Noha.

00:11:48.410 --> 00:11:53.790
Erin told the story of Ophalon Kingdom, which had been at its zenith of prosperity.

00:11:56.110 --> 00:12:00.700
The beast-lords all went mad for blood and destroyed Ophalon Kingdom.

00:12:02.090 --> 00:12:07.930
And the woman who created the cause of this destruction sealed away the technique to control the beast-lords,

00:12:07.930 --> 00:12:11.810
flew down from upon Ephon Noha, and came to this land.

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:16.460
Her name was Je.

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:19.920
The Founding Queen of this Holy Kingdom of Ryoza.

00:12:20.680 --> 00:12:22.940
Your ancestor.

00:12:45.480 --> 00:12:50.220
My ancestor was a human and not a god?

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:54.740
Worse yet, a criminal who committed a serious crime?

00:12:57.970 --> 00:13:01.040
You're telling me to believe such a fanciful tale?

00:13:01.620 --> 00:13:05.190
You think it's fanciful?

00:13:05.190 --> 00:13:09.100
In what sort of position am I to think of telling some fanciful story?

00:13:12.460 --> 00:13:15.020
I was actually asking that of myself.

00:13:16.070 --> 00:13:22.340
For example, you could be working with Ial, the betrayer of Sezans.

00:13:22.340 --> 00:13:30.550
And if Ial is working with Shunan, you could conduct me to take actions as the Grand Duke wishes.

00:13:31.730 --> 00:13:36.520
Who told you that you might visit me during the cleansing?

00:13:37.210 --> 00:13:38.480
It was Ial, was it not?

00:13:42.660 --> 00:13:47.940
Your Majesty, do you not think Lilan is quite different from other beast-lords?

00:13:54.510 --> 00:13:58.980
Yes.  I've never seen a beast-lord as beautiful as her before.

00:14:00.950 --> 00:14:08.670
The beast-lords at care centers do not fly, go into heat, nor do they have any children.

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:13.580
That's because they are raised in accordance to the Beast-Lord Imperatives.

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:18.420
However, Lilan is different.

00:14:19.550 --> 00:14:25.730
When I was instructed to raise Lilan, I wasn't made aware of the Beast-Lord Imperatives.

00:14:25.730 --> 00:14:30.900
That is why I raised Lilan without use of the mute whistle or benetrophic water.

00:14:33.500 --> 00:14:42.900
If one raises them by disobeying the Beast-Lord Imperatives, they fly, have children, and grow up to become such beautiful beast-lords.

00:14:44.030 --> 00:14:45.150
Yes.

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:49.550
Then why did the Founding Queen write such an imperative?

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:52.810
This is what I think:

00:14:54.180 --> 00:14:59.350
She didn't want the tragedy she brought about to be repeated.

00:15:00.490 --> 00:15:05.720
However, if beast-lords are used as a symbol, the creature everyone believes to be a harbinger of miracles,

00:15:05.720 --> 00:15:10.570
the citizens can be controlled with the pure will of a "god," instead of with military power.

00:15:12.840 --> 00:15:17.180
I believe she created the Beast-Lord Imperatives to permit her to keep the beast-lords near her,

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:21.900
while making it impossible for them to be used as weapons.

00:15:22.660 --> 00:15:27.910
She put down that they be given benetrophic water to inhibit them from going into heat and having children

00:15:27.910 --> 00:15:35.170
and used the mute whistle to create an invisible emotional barrier so that they would never communicate heart-to-heart with people.

00:15:39.160 --> 00:15:43.540
How well have you and that beast-lord bonded?

00:15:44.600 --> 00:15:47.180
We are to the level of understanding that we know each others' wishes.

00:15:48.430 --> 00:15:54.400
However, Lilan and I have a gap which can't be filled.

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:05.120
When I made her angry, she bit off my fingers.

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:09.560
Beast-lords are still beasts.

00:16:09.560 --> 00:16:14.470
Just as how Lilan bared her fangs at me, beast-lords kill Touda on instinct.

00:16:15.890 --> 00:16:21.000
Even then, I do not wish for beast-lords to become tools of war.

00:16:21.850 --> 00:16:24.010
I'm not saying that just for the story I told,

00:16:24.450 --> 00:16:27.060
nor due to my mother's tribal code,

00:16:27.060 --> 00:16:29.460
nor for this country.

00:16:31.160 --> 00:16:38.950
I just don't like seeing beasts living confined in cages wrought by human codes.

00:16:48.570 --> 00:16:52.210
Cages wrought by humans...

00:17:02.220 --> 00:17:06.010
I'm the same as the beast-lords at Lazal.

00:17:07.060 --> 00:17:13.160
I was protected since birth and am expected to become the Queen eventually.

00:17:13.890 --> 00:17:16.330
I never questioned why I was in that situation.

00:17:52.660 --> 00:17:56.270
I guess my grandmother was able to see it.

00:17:57.760 --> 00:18:02.220
How she was living, and how she was kept inside a cage.

00:18:05.030 --> 00:18:12.000
If you hadn't met Lilan, then everyone might still abide by the Beast-lord Imperatives.

00:18:13.320 --> 00:18:17.460
This must be what the gods intended to happen.

00:18:18.020 --> 00:18:24.410
And also how we met today must be part of the gods' intentions as well.

00:18:25.660 --> 00:18:27.100
Don't you think so?

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:30.120
I do not.

00:18:31.350 --> 00:18:35.150
Our meeting is not by the will of the gods.

00:18:36.310 --> 00:18:41.520
If it wasn't for the individual who set up Harumiya-sama's assassination, who pretended to be the Grand Duke,

00:18:41.520 --> 00:18:43.860
I would not be here.

00:18:46.410 --> 00:18:47.680
What are you saying?

00:18:49.210 --> 00:18:57.460
I am here because Damiya-sama threatened that he would kill my teacher Esal if I did not fly on a beast-lord at Tahai Aze.

00:19:19.700 --> 00:19:21.140
What...

00:19:22.580 --> 00:19:24.650
What are you implying?

00:19:28.150 --> 00:19:35.860
Damiya-sama has been employing the use of men wearing masks, to pretend as if they're Saigamul troops.

00:19:37.190 --> 00:19:43.590
Ial-sama of the Sezans caught onto the truth just as he was nearly brought to his death by poison.

00:19:55.300 --> 00:20:01.610
You're...  You're saying that Uncle... killed Grandmother?

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:17.940
Why did Uncle have to kill Grandmother?

00:20:18.900 --> 00:20:26.970
If Harumiya-sama were alive, would she have allowed you two to be wed as man and woman?

00:20:43.360 --> 00:20:47.590
Grandmother was not fond of Uncle.

00:20:50.170 --> 00:20:53.770
But... why would he...

00:20:56.320 --> 00:21:05.740
<i>You may be the Queen to the citizens, but you're still the cute Seimiya to me, no matter what.</i>

00:21:09.880 --> 00:21:11.970
<i>Who is the man that you love?</i>

00:21:51.410 --> 00:21:52.200
Erin!

00:21:52.910 --> 00:21:53.670
Your Majesty.

00:21:54.560 --> 00:21:57.720
You shall stand beside me at Tahai Aze.

00:22:01.470 --> 00:22:04.910
You won't have to do a thing.  Just watch.

00:22:05.560 --> 00:22:07.550
I will give you the freedom to do so.

00:22:08.720 --> 00:22:12.640
The freedom that I do not have.

00:22:15.700 --> 00:22:20.540
Tahai Aze, where the Queen's and Grand Duke's powers would be pit against each other...

00:22:21.640 --> 00:22:26.220
The fated day was approaching.

00:24:02.330 --> 00:24:04.830
The snowy Tahai Aze.

00:24:04.830 --> 00:24:09.900
The history of the pure Kingdom of Ryoza
comes to an end with the sunrise.

00:24:09.900 --> 00:24:17.910
Will the Queen, the path who leads to the gods, wave the blue flag, or will the Touda stain the snow in red?

00:24:17.910 --> 00:24:20.830
Seimiya, tell me what is in your heart now.

00:24:22.330 --> 00:24:25.050
Kemono no Souja Erin.  Dawn at Ryoza.

00:24:25.050 --> 00:26:00.070
Dawn at Ryoza
